## Agent Pipeline

Classify intake → create/update task → then:

`coder → spec-reviewer → reviewer → tester → PM marks done`

Skip full pipeline only for **tiny** lane (see FEATURE_INTAKE.md).

**Agent models:** pm / coder / spec-reviewer / reviewer / tester / planner / product-analyst → `sonnet`; debugger / solution-architect → `opus`; explorer / doc-writer → `haiku`. UI verify: **mobile-mcp** (not agent-browser).

